{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/2998a753258b56bd2602b783e4c56190.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fort Craft is a simulation game in which you conquer and manage forts and also fight battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the siege, then make the reconstruction, and be prepared for defense of your fortification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become Fortification Master ! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair walls, build reinforced cannon posts, rearrange fort for your needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.poster.avif?t=1728241425\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.webm?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564210/extras/74cadaa1af3fb2d02ccf7cde06690fa9.mp4?t=1728241425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild the Fort</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather required materials, make plans and stay prepared</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla